// Ritam 3D — level data. Four worlds of five: Town (1–5), Forest (6–10),
// Caves (11–15), Sky Fortress (16–20). One new idea per level, gem trails that
// trace each jump, high routes with crowns, and every level playtested by a physics
// bot running WEAKER jump/run values than the game, so each jump has a safety margin.
//
//   #  wall      ~  water     ^  fire      |  vine      X  fake wall (secret)
//   *  diamond   r  ruby      o  orb       i  ring      c  crown     $  gold
//   T  gold cup  D  door      J  jetpack   G  gun       F  checkpoint flag
//   k  key       L  lock (opens with the key, or when the boss falls)
//   -  moving platform ↔     !  lift ↕
//   m  blob   h  hopper   w  rocket   u  saucer   B  boss saucer   P  start (home)

// Journey: 200 levels in 10 regions of 20. Levels 1–20 are hand-designed; 21–200 are
// generated with a rising difficulty curve (longer, more enemies, more mechanics) and a boss
// on every 20th level. Every generated level was finished by the playtest bot with a weaker
// jump, slower run, faster enemies and no space pack before being kept.

export const WORLDS = ["Town","Forest","Caves","Sky Fortress"];

